// - A card leaves when its headline starts to leave (b = that headline's end minus about 0.9s), so the next headline
//   never rises through it, and enters at least 0.3s after its own headline.
// - Logos are real files in media/brand/; demo values (calendar times, mail logos) are named as demo at handover.
